MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "Home for Christmas and Buon Natale: The Christmas Album connect clearly to the Christmas albums I have chosen before, giving me a concrete reason to consider them.",
    "The Classic Christmas Album reflects a specific title I returned to, so its connection to my listening feels meaningful."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Titles such as Forte, Stages and Under the Influence give me no clear connection to my previous choices, so I would not spend my limited listening time exploring them.",
    "Best of, WOW Hits 2018 and Greatest Hits: Decade #1 do not tell me enough about the artists or songs to make those collections feel personally relevant."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Returning to The Classic Christmas Album before does not mean I want to revisit it on every visit; today I would prefer to try Home for Christmas.",
    "My earlier Christmas listening seems to carry a lot of weight, but those choices happened together in November 2014 and do not establish what I want on every later visit."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My latest interaction was The New Old Fashioned, much later than the holiday albums; I would want that more recent choice to count, without assuming its title reveals exactly what I liked about it.",
    "Several albums can match my interests without making me choose all of them. On this visit, one clearly relevant new option is enough to get me to interact."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my past Christmas listening, but give me fewer clear reasons to explore beyond that older pattern or revisit an album today."
}
